Hello,

	Since the "big level" and the rarity thereof has been a subject
	of discussion in the past, I thought I'd mention that I encountered
	my first one yesterday on level 15.  I don't remember fully, but it
	seems to me that the majority of posters were unsure if the big 
	level ever appeared when playing in normal (i.e.: non wizard/debug/
	explore) mode.  Well, it just happened to me.  We are running 
	nethack version 3.0i patchlevel 7 here, on a Sun 4 (SunOS 4.1.1).

	Anyway ... I also have a question.  I don't remember seeing this in
	the spoiler file (although I don't use it that much), so ...

	Some levels later (around level 22 or so, I think), I found a wand.
	Engraving with it yielded no clue as to what it might be, so I held
	on to it for a while.  Still later I encountered and killed a black
	dragon.  Hoping that perhaps my wand was a wand of polymorph, I 
	stood back and zapped the corpse.  Another(?) black dragon appeared!
	I killed this one (I think it was the same one; there was only one
	corpse.), and thinking this somewhat strange, but not being able to
	believe my eyes, I tried it again with the same result.  I haven't
	used this wand since.  Any clues as to what it might be?

